      "largeTitle": "Vocal Production: Elevating Your Vocal Performances",
      "fullDescription": "As a vocal producer, I specialize in bringing out the best in a singer's performance. I assist singers with their vocal melodies, ensuring they deliver the best possible performance for their recordings. I offer specialized services such as correcting, mixing, and arranging vocals. I am skilled at pitch correction, vocal comping, and I can enhance performances using effects and processing tools. My job is to make the vocal shine, ensuring it fits perfectly within the mix and contributes effectively to the song's overall feel and message.",
      "details": {
        "intro": "As a **vocal producer**, I guide artists to capture the best vocal performances. My role is to extract the emotion and power from each voice.",
